10:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","children":"Kalkulyatordan qanday foydalanish"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none text-muted-foreground space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Kalkulyator qanday ishlaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Viza narxi kalkulyatori O'zbekiston fuqarolari uchun turistik safar xarajatlarini hisoblaydi: konsullik yig'imi, viza markazining servis yig'imi, foto va tibbiy sug'urta. Hujjatlar tarjimasi jamiga kirmaydi, narxini quyida ko'ring. Hisob bitta arizachi uchun. Turkiya, BAA va 30 kungacha Xitoyga turistik viza kerak emas, shuning uchun ular uchun kalkulyator faqat sug'urta va fotoni ko'rsatadi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash formulasi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"2026-yilda vizaga taxminiy xarajatlar: Shengen — konsullik yig'imi €90, viza markazi servis yig'imi €20-30, foto 30 000-50 000 so'm, notarial tasdiqli hujjatlar tarjimasi 200 000-500 000 so'm, €30 000 qoplamali tibbiy sug'urta 200 000 so'mdan (15 kun) 800 000 so'mgacha (90 kun). AQSh (B1/B2) — $185; AQSh qonuni bilan $250 Visa Integrity Fee ham joriy etilgan, ammo undirish boshlanishini elchixona saytidan aniqlang, shuning uchun u alohida ko'rsatiladi va jamiga kirmaydi. Buyuk Britaniya — 6 oylik viza £135 (2026-yil 8-apreldan). Janubiy Koreya — taxminan $40-80, hujjatlarni faqat akkreditatsiyalangan agentliklar qabul qiladi. Yaponiya — konsullik yig'imi yo'q, agentlik orqali murojaat qilsangiz, faqat uning xizmati to'lanadi. So'mdagi summalarni kalkulyator yig'im valyutasi (yevro, funt yoki dollar) bo'yicha MB kursida hisoblaydi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash misoli"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Oila uchun misol (Shengen, 2 katta va 6-12 yoshli bola), yevro 13 400 so'm kursida: konsullik yig'imi €90 × 2 + €45 = €225 (~3 015 000 so'm); servis yig'imi €25 × 3 = €75 (~1 005 000 so'm); foto 40 000 × 3 = 120 000 so'm; hujjatlar tarjimasi 400 000 × 3 = 1 200 000 so'm; sug'urta 300 000 × 3 = 900 000 so'm. Oilaga jami: ~6 240 000 so'm. 6-12 yoshli bolalar uchun Shengen konsullik yig'imi €45, 6 yoshgacha bepul. Kalkulyator bitta katta uchun hisoblaydi, oila summasini qo'lda qo'shing."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Nimalarni hisobga olish kerak"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"O'zbekiston fuqarolari vizasiz, jumladan, quyidagilarga borishi mumkin: Rossiya (yiliga 90 sutka), Qozog'iston (30 kun), Qirg'iziston (60), Tojikiston (30), Ozarbayjon (90), Armaniston (180), Belarus, Moldova va Ukraina (180 kunda 90 kun), Gruziya (365), Turkiya (180 kunda 90 kun), Xitoy (bir kirishda 30 kun, 180 kunda 90 kundan oshmasin), BAA (30), Malayziya (30), Mo'g'uliston (30). Indoneziyaga kelganda viza olinadi (30 kungacha, 500 000 rupiya). Janubiy Koreya, Singapur va Shengen uchun viza oldindan kerak. Elektron viza, masalan, Hindiston va Vyetnamga mavjud. Qoidalar o'zgaradi, safardan oldin talablarni mamlakat elchixonasi yoki O'zbekiston TIV saytida tekshiring."}]]}]]}],"$L16"]}],null,"$L17","$L18"]}]
